d_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"7gtWQMLOEwCxh1I5j6uB4g","review_id":"khBsY094IylhX6WrXwYF8w","date":"2021-06-08T00:43:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9424252510070801,"text_excerpt":"Came here on a Friday afternoon and was a great place to stop and relax for a bit. Got their 3 cheese plate which was great because it comes with a heap of bread, 3 cheese of your choice (from their list), some salami, and a few fruits and jam. I got the sauv blanc that they were currently serving and it was a perfect combo and only $10 for HH!"},{"business_id":"7gtWQMLOEwCxh1I5j6uB4g","review_id":"RHT7lFqVrCKMS-a-SJmZgQ","date":"2017-10-08T17:04:06","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9412034749984741,"text_excerpt":"This is my new favorite place for a meal in New Orleans. They offer an incredible selection of cheese (duh)! They also have great sandwiches and great cured meats. I love the charcuterie board which you can customize or go with the chef's selection. I always go with the chef's selection and never miss. In addition to the cheeses and meats on the boards, the chutney, mustard, and other add ons are great. They do a nice job of mixing and matching. If you want to do something different, check out one of their locations. I really like the Warehouse District location. The Uptown location is good too."},{"business_id":"7gtWQMLOEwCxh1I5j6uB4g","review_id":"jXjE-Wy1SCagmNerMwO1dw","date":"2017-03-19T16:21:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9397963285446167,"text_excerpt":"Came for a late-afternoon lunch. They have a lot of great salad and sandwich options -basically all death by cheese -yum! I had the salad special of the day, which included fennel and citrus. I was very pleased. The restaurant is big, so lots of places to sit. I'm guessing this comes in handy given their location and what I presume is a lunch rush during the work week. It even looked like they had some outdoor seating for when it gets warm out. With the cheese variety offered, I'm pretty sure their happy hour is incredible. Sadly we missed the opportunity to try it!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"7gtWQMLOEwCxh1I5j6uB4g","photo_id":"wLhqFHOj2pgxXnRHVD4mEA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/wLhqFHOj2pgxXnRHVD4mEA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9321349263191223},{"business_id":"7gtWQMLOEwCxh1I5j6uB4g","photo_id":"aUi7mH7pm3r7PpWdpxdN7A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/aUi7mH7pm3r7PpWdpxdN7A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8925507068634033},{"business_id":"7gtWQMLOEwCxh1I5j6uB4g","photo_id":"Q7UAtz7EbLIyF3eoRj2ICw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Q7UAtz7EbLIyF3eoRj2ICw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8466522693634033},{"business_id":"7gtWQMLOEwCxh1I5j6uB4g","photo_id":"STZtxTHDmmiuTchgYPyS9g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/STZtxTHDmmiuTchgYPyS9g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8057020902633667},{"business_id":"7gtWQMLOEwCxh1I5j6uB4g","photo_id":"52AUCZ9eXYs1LFlJVb9B2g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/52AUCZ9eXYs1LFlJVb9B2g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7760356664657593}]},"notebook_case":null}
